{"data":{"rateLimit":{"remaining":4936,"resetAt":"2026-07-22T18:19:34Z"},"repository":{"pullRequest":{"id":"PR_kwDOB_zxBs7rIxyS","number":5732,"title":"Prototype: Fold the staging functionality into the main view","body":"This is a prototype of a major change to how staging works:\r\n- there is no longer a separate staging (or patch-building) panel, this is now done directly from the main view\r\n- for this purpose, the main view gets a selection when focused, which works the same way as the one in the former staging view\r\n- this works even when a pager is used, as long as the pager supports the new OSC protocol described in https://github.com/jesseduffield/lazygit/pull/5731\r\n- many other things that I forgot to list here.\r\n\r\nIn order to illustrate this better I made [a video](https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/h9s6xcvjik9c7wgna2sb1/Lazygit-Staging-in-Main-View.mp4?rlkey=k8uuj990qw5ld6tfsf1k8dawj&raw=1) to demo it. Unfortunately it got a little longer than I had planned, I'm not experienced in producing content like this.\r\n\r\nPrototype branches for the three mentioned pagers are here: [delta](https://github.com/dandavison/delta/compare/main...stefanhaller:delta:prototype-osc-metadata), [diff-so-fancy](https://github.com/so-fancy/diff-so-fancy/compare/next...stefanhaller:diff-so-fancy:prototype-osc-metadata), [difftastic](https://github.com/Wilfred/difftastic/compare/master...stefanhaller:difftastic:prototype-osc-metadata).\r\n\r\nFor feedback on the OSC spec, please comment on #5731, not here.","state":"OPEN","isDraft":true,"url":"https://github.com/jesseduffield/lazygit/pull/5732","createdAt":"2026-06-26T21:05:34Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-19T17:00:28Z","author":{"login":"stefanhaller"},"baseRefName":"master","headRefName":"fold-staging-functionality-into-main-view","headRefOid":"ad54705921b564d5233a67bb3d2ea52ac65ad1aa","additions":14414,"deletions":608,"changedFiles":124,"mergeable":"MERGEABLE","reviewDecision":null,"labels":{"nodes":[{"name":"enhancement","co